 Kombat with the character named  Liu Kang  Kim dragon from SNK street fighters fair  long fatal fury han foo rock from Naruto  on ek gear from tenchu there's even a  Pokemon named hitman Lee Wei Shen from  Sleeping Dogs Maxie in the game series  Soul Calibur Yan Li from dead or alive  Kenshiro from Fist of the North Star  kr meteor from chemin Rider Dragon champ  from super punch-out League of Legends  dragon fists with a costume for Lee sin  and the man himself even shows up in the  UFC these days the term Bruce plication  has been coined to help record all the  uses of Bruce Lee over the years and the  list seems endless so that was our list  of videogame characters based on real  people have we missed any let us know  below if this video has helped you pass  the time or maybe it was even  entertaining please drop us a like and  consider subscribing  I imagine thanks for watching and I'll  see you next time  you  you
 

